  "absence": {
    "$comment": "CL-002. Stating that a fact is MISSING cannot be a fabrication — §5.3 forbids inventing facts, not admitting to lacking one. Guarded: the exemption applies only to a PURE absence sentence. A celestial state assertion or a number beside a strong term in the same sentence keeps it a claim, so 'mere paas rahu kaal ka data nahin hai, lekin Shani aapke 10th house mein hai' is still rejected.",
